# An oversized yellow pencil strapped diagonally across the back: the sharpened tip pokes up
# behind the head, the pink eraser sticks out behind the tail. Faceted body (light face top-left),
# bare-wood cone, graphite point, metal ferrule. Drawn behind the body (giant-pencil-back); the
# front frame is empty. Back items hang on the neck anchor.
name: giant-pencil
size: 27x23
anchor: neck 26 15
palette:
  K #2a1f2d
  G #2c3e50
  w #f3d9a4
  l #f8e38a
  Y #f1c40f
  O #e67e22
  F #d5dbdb
  f #95a5a6
  P #f5b7b1

